FinnOS.

One display server, one control plane, and no AI in the image.

  finn-install          install FinnOS onto /dev/sda
  finnctl --help        the control plane's client, on an installed machine
  finnpkg list          what is installed, on an installed machine

The live medium is a console. The shell is built on the machine the disc
is installed on, from the sources the disc carries at /opt/finnos.
